OL,3,GNEWSABradford Live in running for
OL,4,Arenovation award
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford Live has been nominated in the
OL,7,FGreat Renovation category of a new
OL,8,Fnational award.
OL,10,FThe #50m music and events venue is up
OL,11,Fagainst three others in the inaugural
OL,12,FGreat British Theatres Awards to be
OL,13,Fheld in London on 2 November.
OL,15,FIt was built inside the shell of the
OL,16,Fcity's old Odeon and opened 25 years
OL,17,Fafter the Art Deco building closed its
OL,18,Fdoors to cinema-goers.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
