OL,3,GNEWSABradford Live in running for
OL,4,Arenovation award
OL,5,
OL,6,FStephen Place, leader of Bradford
OL,7,FCouncil, said: "The transformation of
OL,8,Fthis historic building into a modern
OL,9,Fentertainment venue is a tremendous
OL,10,Fachievement, and the whole of Bradford
OL,11,Fshould be proud."
